{"n": 7548, "src": "Když se dotkne kočky, jeho tělo reaguje okamžitě. Naprostá katastrofa!", "en": "If he touches a cat, his body reacts instantly. Absolute disaster!", "lk_supplied": "reacts", "topic": "0 Conditional", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": true}
