{"n": 7556, "src": "Zatímco visela na hrazdě, kamarádka vklouzla pod ni.", "en": "While she was hanging there, her friend stepped in to support her.", "lk_supplied": "stepped", "topic": "Past Simple or Continuos", "level": "B1", "person": "3sg", "number": "sg", "perfective_present": false}
